[00:35.44]Bearing his fangs, hopelessly locked in the stare
[00:40.42]He comes with no legions tonight
[00:43.87]Eyes flashing fire, burning with coldest of flames
[00:48.81]Resolved to extinguish my light
[00:50.83]I stand reflecting his gaze
[00:57.12]Yet something confounds what I see
[01:00.03]Not embers but ice, yet only a trace
[01:05.42]Familiar only to me
[01:09.61]
[01:58.94]Rise and peer at the stars
[02:02.88]Somewhere among them he sleeps
[02:07.20]Only I know who you are
[02:11.18]And all of the horrors you keep
[02:15.79]
[02:51.18]No trace of you, but your echoes fill my ears
[02:59.45]I'll scale the stars, murderous when you appear
[03:05.44]And slowly then from the heavens we'll descend
[03:16.49]Hands wrapped around each other's throats until the end
[03:27.61]
[03:57.64]Soul is severed from flesh
[04:00.71]Discarding the dimming wish of reprieve
[04:05.99]Scholar in arts of erasure
[04:10.35]Promising not to deceive
[04:14.32]Sights which bear no logic encircle my fragmented form
[04:21.62]It seems you shall be the author of pages
[04:26.94]I hoped I'd indelibly torn
[04:31.28]I've read back through this tome
[04:38.25]Through chapters of the endless war of our shared past
[04:47.98]I'll make this volume my own
[04:54.74]When I inscribe: "This starlit battle will be our last."
[05:09.07]
[07:34.84]Rise, and peer at the stars
[07:38.99]Somewhere among them he sleeps
[07:43.29]I've always known who you are
[07:47.35]And that which forever binds you to me
[07:51.52]